<title>DENMARK: SAS confirms 1.8bln skr 96 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>SAS confirms 1.8bln skr 96 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) confirmed on Friday its 1996 pre-tax profit of 1.815 billion Swedish crowns, identical to preliminary data originally announced on February 17.</p>
<p>The result compared with a group pre-tax profit of 2.632 billion Swedish crowns in 1995 on turnover of 35.189 billion Swedish crowns against the previous year's 35.403 billion Swedish crowns.</p>
<p>The final data conformed to all preliminary figures released.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
